graph TD
    subgraph Application Instances (e.g., 20 Threads / Coroutines)
        T1[Thread 1]
        T2[Thread 2]
        T3[Thread 3]
        T4[Thread 4]
        TN[Thread N]
    end

    subgraph Client-Side Connection Pool (e.g., HikariCP / asyncpg pool)
        Available["Available Connections: [ Conn 1, Conn 2, Conn 3 ]"]
        Active["In-Use / Borrowed: [ Conn 4, Conn 5 ]"]
        Waiting["Request Queue: [ Thread Waiting ]"]
    end

    subgraph Database Server
        Backend1[PostgreSQL Worker Process 1]
        Backend2[PostgreSQL Worker Process 2]
        Backend3[PostgreSQL Worker Process 3]
        Backend4[PostgreSQL Worker Process 4]
        Backend5[PostgreSQL Worker Process 5]
    end

    T1 -->|Borrow Connection| Available
    Available -->|Assigned| Active
    T2 -->|Borrow - Pool Exhausted| Waiting
    Active -->|Reuse Existing TCP Session| Backend1
    Active -->|Reuse Existing TCP Session| Backend2
